1
00:00:01,852 --> 00:00:05,178
Over mountains high and through valleys deep

2
00:00:05,332 --> 00:00:08,258
Soaring freely in the sky just like a plane

3
00:00:08,853 --> 00:00:11,938
Honest and kind, Hattori brings joy to all

4
00:00:12,365 --> 00:00:15,883
With wide round eyes and tightly shut lips

5
00:00:15,923 --> 00:00:19,408
Masked face hidden and cheeks puffed out

6
00:00:19,458 --> 00:00:22,928
Catching villains quick as a flash of lightning

7
00:00:22,978 --> 00:00:26,098
Tricking baddies with wacky new ninja tricks

8
00:00:26,738 --> 00:00:29,978
Polite and spirited, speaking like poetry

9
00:00:31,842 --> 00:00:35,062
"Frogs Are the Scariest"

10
00:00:36,369 --> 00:00:37,818
Here, I brought souvenirs

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,363
Woah, what is it?

12
00:00:39,403 --> 00:00:40,498
Can we eat it?

13
00:00:40,548 --> 00:00:41,929
Kenichi, open it up

14
00:00:41,969 --> 00:00:42,754
Okay

15
00:00:45,499 --> 00:00:46,519
What is this?

16
00:00:50,059 --> 00:00:52,349
Woah, it's a frog ornament!

17
00:00:52,399 --> 00:00:53,559
Oh, how did you get it?

18
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:56,183
It's my 20-year perfect attendance award from the company

19
00:00:56,223 --> 00:00:57,996
The company gave us a frog this time

20
00:00:58,046 --> 00:01:00,106
Hoping we'll always work hard

21
00:01:00,616 --> 00:01:02,953
That's amazing, it looks so real!

22
00:01:03,003 --> 00:01:03,846
Of course

23
00:01:04,063 --> 00:01:05,143
It's so cute

24
00:01:05,830 --> 00:01:06,943
And really pretty too

25
00:01:06,994 --> 00:01:09,190
Sounds like they're having fun over there

26
00:01:09,241 --> 00:01:11,366
Hey, Hattori-kun, take a look

27
00:01:11,417 --> 00:01:12,343
Isn't it pretty?

28
00:01:12,416 --> 00:01:14,355
Dad got it as an award from his company

29
00:01:14,405 --> 00:01:15,815
Yan...

30
00:01:18,426 --> 00:01:19,747
Oh, Hattori-kun!

31
00:01:19,798 --> 00:01:20,741
Hey...

32
00:01:21,890 --> 00:01:24,032
What's wrong, Hattori-kun?

33
00:01:25,501 --> 00:01:27,986
The thing my brother hates most in the world is frogs

34
00:01:28,026 --> 00:01:29,332
He looks terrified

35
00:01:29,373 --> 00:01:30,941
I never would have guessed

36
00:01:39,147 --> 00:01:40,783
Not in my wildest dreams

37
00:01:40,824 --> 00:01:42,462
That Hattori-kun is so scared of frogs!

38
00:01:42,503 --> 00:01:43,240
Tell me about it

39
00:01:43,289 --> 00:01:45,990
Hattori-kun completely panics whenever he sees a frog

40
00:01:46,146 --> 00:01:48,049
What? He's afraid of frogs?

41
00:01:49,717 --> 00:01:51,154
Ribbit, ribbit

42
00:01:51,848 --> 00:01:53,449
Actually, when I look closely

43
00:01:53,489 --> 00:01:54,844
Frogs look really cute

44
00:01:54,895 --> 00:01:55,965
Yeah, that's right

45
00:01:56,015 --> 00:01:58,517
I want to observe it now, here, hold this

46
00:02:00,376 --> 00:02:02,018
Today's weather is... Huh?

47
00:02:02,688 --> 00:02:05,257
Oh no, don't run away! Hey... don't go!

48
00:02:05,363 --> 00:02:07,480
Hey, oh no... don't run away!

49
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:09,847
Kenichi, what are you doing?

50
00:02:10,208 --> 00:02:12,178
Oh no, catch it, quick!

51
00:02:13,770 --> 00:02:15,350
Ribbit...

52
00:02:20,716 --> 00:02:22,696
Strange, I clearly saw it hop over here

53
00:02:22,747 --> 00:02:24,510
Why is it gone again?

54
00:02:25,750 --> 00:02:27,897
Frog...

55
00:02:29,665 --> 00:02:32,447
Oh no, did it get away?

56
00:02:32,747 --> 00:02:33,673
What should I do?

57
00:02:33,713 --> 00:02:35,764
It was my turn to look after it today

58
00:02:35,814 --> 00:02:37,555
Which means I failed my responsibility

59
00:02:37,608 --> 00:02:39,783
I'm so sorry, Yumeko

60
00:02:39,834 --> 00:02:41,014
What should I do?

61
00:02:42,774 --> 00:02:44,344
Oh no, this is terrible

62
00:02:44,387 --> 00:02:46,297
The whole class put their heart and soul into this frog

63
00:02:46,338 --> 00:02:48,285
We raised it all the way from a tadpole

64
00:02:48,326 --> 00:02:50,160
If it's lost, we'll get blamed

65
00:02:51,076 --> 00:02:53,013
Oh, poor Yumeko

66
00:02:53,063 --> 00:02:54,500
Don't worry, I'll definitely help you find it

67
00:02:54,550 --> 00:02:56,316
Come on, dry your tears first

68
00:02:56,816 --> 00:02:59,457
Thank you, you really care about me

69
00:02:59,507 --> 00:03:00,950
Well, yes and no

70
00:03:01,690 --> 00:03:03,718
I have to do it this way this time

71
00:03:03,769 --> 00:03:05,506
First, I'll use the frog

72
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,956
To deal with Hattori-kun

73
00:03:07,006 --> 00:03:08,923
At least scare him half to death

74
00:03:08,963 --> 00:03:11,183
Then I'll return the frog to Yumeko

75
00:03:11,233 --> 00:03:13,727
And then Yumeko will even think I'm a great guy

76
00:03:13,767 --> 00:03:15,968
That's what I'll do, perfect!

77
00:03:17,419 --> 00:03:18,443
Awesome!

78
00:03:18,493 --> 00:03:19,236
Yan...

79
00:03:19,277 --> 00:03:20,876
What? Look for a frog?

80
00:03:20,926 --> 00:03:23,339
Hattori-kun, please help me, I'm begging you

81
00:03:23,390 --> 00:03:26,186
Please, will you help me look for it?

82
00:03:31,312 --> 00:03:33,340
The school is really quiet today

83
00:03:33,390 --> 00:03:35,447
It's Saturday, so all the students have gone home

84
00:03:35,487 --> 00:03:36,426
That's why it's so quiet

85
00:03:36,476 --> 00:03:37,730
Come on, let's search quickly

86
00:03:37,770 --> 00:03:39,820
I'm sure the frog couldn't have gone far

87
00:03:39,861 --> 00:03:41,095
It's definitely nearby

88
00:03:44,657 --> 00:03:46,742
Hattori-kun, what are you doing up in the tree?

89
00:03:46,897 --> 00:03:48,097
It's really hard to find

90
00:03:48,138 --> 00:03:49,317
No idea where that frog went

91
00:03:49,368 --> 00:03:51,224
Hey, why on earth would you look up there?

92
00:03:51,264 --> 00:03:52,705
You're supposed to search on the ground

93
00:03:52,745 --> 00:03:54,159
Oh, that's true, isn't it?

94
00:03:56,012 --> 00:03:57,298
Huh? Not here?

95
00:03:58,170 --> 00:03:59,307
Nothing?

96
00:03:59,357 --> 00:04:01,060
Yan... Oof!

97
00:04:01,790 --> 00:04:03,452
Not here either

98
00:04:04,036 --> 00:04:05,140
Nothing here either

99
00:04:05,190 --> 00:04:06,343
Yan...

100
00:04:06,383 --> 00:04:07,660
Not here either

101
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:09,586
Hey, Hattori-kun, did you find anything?

102
00:04:09,626 --> 00:04:11,696
Hurry up, we still have a lot of places to check

103
00:04:11,736 --> 00:04:12,966
It's not that I'm not trying

104
00:04:13,016 --> 00:04:15,177
I'm actually searching really hard

105
00:04:19,511 --> 00:04:20,943
Yan...

106
00:04:23,159 --> 00:04:24,719
If you want me to hand over the frog

107
00:04:24,759 --> 00:04:27,320
Come to Field 3 right away for a duel to the death

108
00:04:27,855 --> 00:04:30,149
So that's it! No wonder we couldn't find it anywhere

109
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,633
- So it's Kemumaki...
- That Koga ninja

110
00:04:31,673 --> 00:04:34,018
Kemumaki is so despicable, ugh!

111
00:04:34,941 --> 00:04:36,918
How tough can Hattori-kun really be?

112
00:04:37,104 --> 00:04:38,218
You're definitely the stronger one, Master

113
00:04:38,281 --> 00:04:39,806
That's why he's scared of you

114
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:42,948
Look, here they come

115
00:04:44,515 --> 00:04:46,338
Yan...

116
00:04:47,501 --> 00:04:49,720
It really is Hattori-kun, they're coming

117
00:04:49,770 --> 00:04:51,737
Yan...

118
00:04:55,577 --> 00:04:57,217
Hey, are you guys okay?

119
00:04:57,258 --> 00:04:59,638
This is a trap, are you alright?

120
00:05:02,030 --> 00:05:03,787
Kemumaki, you're so despicable!

121
00:05:03,831 --> 00:05:06,324
If you know what's good for you, hand over that frog!

122
00:05:07,238 --> 00:05:08,727
Of course I will

123
00:05:08,777 --> 00:05:10,120
Alright, here it is back

124
00:05:10,170 --> 00:05:11,738
Yan... Ouch!

125
00:05:12,270 --> 00:05:13,181
Big Brother!

126
00:05:13,232 --> 00:05:14,570
Oh no, don't!

127
00:05:14,671 --> 00:05:16,940
Did you see that? Aren't my skills amazing?

128
00:05:16,996 --> 00:05:18,988
I already know your weakness

129
00:05:19,423 --> 00:05:21,811
As long as I don't look at the frog, nothing can bother me

130
00:05:21,851 --> 00:05:22,811
Yan...

131
00:05:22,851 --> 00:05:25,687
Take that! It's the Frog-Phobia Breaking Ninja Technique!

132
00:05:25,738 --> 00:05:26,779
Yan...

133
00:05:26,897 --> 00:05:28,517
What a bizarre name

134
00:05:28,657 --> 00:05:30,380
Ribbit...

135
00:05:30,683 --> 00:05:31,845
Way to go, Hattori-kun!

136
00:05:31,896 --> 00:05:33,647
Big Brother, go for it!

137
00:05:33,697 --> 00:05:35,173
Shut your mouth!

138
00:05:35,368 --> 00:05:36,930
Go for it...

139
00:05:36,970 --> 00:05:39,286
-Still being noisy, huh? Still making noise...
-Big Brother, go get him!

140
00:05:39,444 --> 00:05:41,106
Big Brother, go get him!

141
00:05:41,428 --> 00:05:43,973
Yan...

142
00:05:44,871 --> 00:05:46,239
Hang in there!

143
00:05:46,369 --> 00:05:47,578
-Quiet down and sit there!
-Big Brother!

144
00:05:47,619 --> 00:05:49,307
Shut up! Quiet down!

145
00:06:03,718 --> 00:06:04,651
No need to ask

146
00:06:04,691 --> 00:06:06,811
They must have passed out from my crying

147
00:06:07,671 --> 00:06:09,887
Little froggy, wake up!

148
00:06:09,927 --> 00:06:12,100
Otherwise, Kenichi will be in big trouble!

149
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:13,796
Wake up, quick!

150
00:06:16,387 --> 00:06:18,500
Come on, move! Wake up!

151
00:06:18,540 --> 00:06:20,214
Wake up, quick!

152
00:06:20,592 --> 00:06:22,303
Little froggy!

153
00:06:23,831 --> 00:06:26,037
Yan...

154
00:06:29,708 --> 00:06:33,027
"Where Is the 20-Point Test Paper?"

155
00:06:39,209 --> 00:06:40,480
Yumeko!

156
00:06:40,530 --> 00:06:42,513
Why do you look so down?

157
00:06:42,563 --> 00:06:43,526
Kenichi...

158
00:06:43,576 --> 00:06:46,039
Didn't you know they handed back test papers today?

159
00:06:46,079 --> 00:06:47,771
Yeah, they did. So what?

160
00:06:47,811 --> 00:06:49,725
My test score was terrible

161
00:06:49,776 --> 00:06:51,512
Mom is definitely going to scold me when I get home

162
00:06:51,553 --> 00:06:53,345
So that's what this is all about?

163
00:06:53,395 --> 00:06:55,658
My score was awful, only 60 points

164
00:06:55,708 --> 00:06:57,224
Mom's totally going to yell at me

165
00:06:57,274 --> 00:06:58,715
60 points?

166
00:07:08,917 --> 00:07:10,960
If she's this disappointed with 60

167
00:07:11,010 --> 00:07:13,140
isn't my 20 totally hopeless?

168
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:14,276
Kenichi

169
00:07:14,327 --> 00:07:14,893
Yes?

170
00:07:14,944 --> 00:07:16,185
What are you reading?

171
00:07:16,226 --> 00:07:17,869
I'm... I'm burning leaves

172
00:07:17,910 --> 00:07:20,352
Oh, really? Well, be careful with the fire

173
00:07:22,231 --> 00:07:25,030
I might as well just burn this stupid test paper

174
00:07:25,456 --> 00:07:26,335
Oh no!

175
00:07:30,808 --> 00:07:32,978
Oh no, my 20-pointer flew away! Oh no!

176
00:07:36,964 --> 00:07:38,832
Where did the test paper go?

177
00:07:39,883 --> 00:07:41,943
There it is, right here...

178
00:07:46,023 --> 00:07:48,138
Hey, wait!

179
00:07:48,813 --> 00:07:51,596
Excuse me, ma'am, how do I get down this road?

180
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:55,463
Wait! Hey...

181
00:08:02,342 --> 00:08:03,436
Hey, wait...

182
00:08:05,278 --> 00:08:06,976
Oh, hey, wait up!

183
00:08:15,258 --> 00:08:17,022
Oh no, he's delivering it back over there!

184
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:22,653
Ma'am, do you need to buy anything today?

185
00:08:22,694 --> 00:08:23,592
Oh, wait a moment

186
00:08:23,633 --> 00:08:26,394
We still have lots of soy sauce, and there's still plenty of sake left

187
00:08:26,607 --> 00:08:29,522
Please don't let him find it, please!

188
00:08:30,708 --> 00:08:32,511
Why is Kenichi acting so suspiciously?

189
00:08:32,551 --> 00:08:34,872
Thanks, but it looks like we don't need anything today

190
00:08:34,923 --> 00:08:37,418
Oh, no problem, maybe next time!

191
00:08:38,383 --> 00:08:39,344
Great!

192
00:08:43,061 --> 00:08:44,513
Hey, wait a second!

193
00:08:46,066 --> 00:08:47,484
Is that you, Kenichi?

194
00:08:47,848 --> 00:08:49,141
Kenichi, what are you doing here?

195
00:08:49,182 --> 00:08:50,121
Is something wrong?

196
00:08:50,162 --> 00:08:53,018
N-Nothing, just practicing running

197
00:08:53,059 --> 00:08:55,456
Just doing exercises, one, two, three, four

198
00:08:56,315 --> 00:08:57,689
How strange

199
00:08:57,776 --> 00:08:58,689
Oh right, clerk!

200
00:08:58,730 --> 00:09:01,101
Next time, please bring me a bottle of oyster sauce along the way

201
00:09:01,142 --> 00:09:02,177
One bottle of oyster sauce, right?

202
00:09:02,227 --> 00:09:03,198
You got it

203
00:09:04,214 --> 00:09:05,498
I saw everything!

204
00:09:05,590 --> 00:09:06,888
This is great!

205
00:09:06,939 --> 00:09:08,730
Let's go, let's go!

206
00:09:08,793 --> 00:09:10,818
Got it, got it, on our way...

207
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:14,857
Hattori-kun, please!

208
00:09:14,907 --> 00:09:16,190
Think of something to help me!

209
00:09:16,230 --> 00:09:17,638
If that delivery guy finds it

210
00:09:17,688 --> 00:09:19,591
I'll be in big trouble this time!

211
00:09:19,678 --> 00:09:21,436
This is quite a tricky matter

212
00:09:21,486 --> 00:09:23,968
Alright, I'll think of something, yan...

213
00:09:24,088 --> 00:09:25,664
That's a relief

214
00:09:25,982 --> 00:09:26,920
Shinzo

215
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:29,162
You need to go put your skills into practice now

216
00:09:29,202 --> 00:09:30,400
I understand, big brother!

217
00:09:30,450 --> 00:09:31,736
Radio Control Ninja Technique

218
00:09:31,787 --> 00:09:33,618
Radio Control Ninja Technique?

219
00:09:37,615 --> 00:09:38,921
Watch this!

220
00:09:39,075 --> 00:09:40,967
It's just an ordinary paper airplane

221
00:09:41,553 --> 00:09:42,558
Don't worry

222
00:09:42,619 --> 00:09:44,100
He uses ninja technique to focus his mind

223
00:09:44,146 --> 00:09:46,426
to control how the paper airplane flies

224
00:09:50,469 --> 00:09:52,851
Ling...

225
00:10:00,072 --> 00:10:03,139
- Roasted sweet potatoes
- Ling... ah?

226
00:10:03,179 --> 00:10:05,220
Roasted sweet potatoes!

227
00:10:06,664 --> 00:10:07,889
Your skills aren't there yet!

228
00:10:07,930 --> 00:10:09,451
I'm sorry, big brother

229
00:10:12,085 --> 00:10:13,045
What's going on?

230
00:10:21,212 --> 00:10:22,538
Got it!

231
00:10:26,164 --> 00:10:27,665
Uh, excuse me, mister

232
00:10:27,996 --> 00:10:30,195
My paper airplane fell into the goods in your trunk

233
00:10:30,235 --> 00:10:31,608
Please let me get it back

234
00:10:34,264 --> 00:10:35,917
It's right here...

235
00:10:36,268 --> 00:10:38,511
I've discovered Kenichi's secret!

236
00:10:40,874 --> 00:10:42,027
Retreat!

237
00:10:42,474 --> 00:10:43,667
Don't run!

238
00:10:46,339 --> 00:10:48,058
Hattori-kun, what do you want?

239
00:10:48,191 --> 00:10:49,931
I was worried you'd try to sabotage things

240
00:10:49,972 --> 00:10:51,884
so I followed Shinzo over here

241
00:10:51,925 --> 00:10:54,233
This is Ninja Magic Technique, yan...

242
00:10:54,284 --> 00:10:56,414
Agh, this is outrageous!

243
00:10:57,832 --> 00:10:59,634
Yan...

244
00:10:59,674 --> 00:11:01,324
Kagechiyo, fetch it!

245
00:11:02,828 --> 00:11:05,055
You won't get it that easily, watch this!

246
00:11:05,112 --> 00:11:06,814
Yan...

247
00:11:13,735 --> 00:11:14,800
Now where is it?

248
00:11:14,850 --> 00:11:16,646
Which one is Kenichi's test paper?

249
00:11:17,181 --> 00:11:18,843
I think it's this one

250
00:11:20,912 --> 00:11:22,825
Kemumaki's ninja skills are actually pretty lousy

251
00:11:22,876 --> 00:11:23,919
He only got 20 marks

252
00:11:23,970 --> 00:11:26,559
Agh, why did you fetch something like this?

253
00:11:29,797 --> 00:11:31,439
Huh, Hattori-kun left already

254
00:11:32,465 --> 00:11:34,953
I wonder if Hattori-kun managed to get the test paper back?

255
00:11:34,993 --> 00:11:37,232
I know my brother's ninja skills are top-notch

256
00:11:37,272 --> 00:11:39,599
There's no way he'd lose to Kemumaki

257
00:11:39,872 --> 00:11:41,087
Hattori-kun!

258
00:11:41,656 --> 00:11:42,545
How are you doing, Kenichi?

259
00:11:42,595 --> 00:11:43,932
You're back? How did it go?

260
00:11:43,973 --> 00:11:45,026
Where's the test paper?

261
00:11:45,186 --> 00:11:46,698
Did... did you get the test paper back?

262
00:11:46,749 --> 00:11:48,431
Mm, no need to worry, Kenichi

263
00:11:48,472 --> 00:11:50,653
I have successfully retrieved the test paper

264
00:11:50,819 --> 00:11:53,021
That's great! Thank you so much, thank you!

265
00:11:53,068 --> 00:11:55,028
Yan... no need to worry

266
00:11:55,068 --> 00:11:56,710
I already gave your test paper to her

267
00:11:56,761 --> 00:11:58,100
Gave... gave it to who?

268
00:11:58,400 --> 00:11:59,347
To who?

269
00:11:59,387 --> 00:12:01,880
Weren't you planning to show your test paper to your mom?

270
00:12:01,930 --> 00:12:04,506
Agh, when did I ever say I'd show it to Mom?

271
00:12:04,546 --> 00:12:06,018
Yan...

272
00:12:06,610 --> 00:12:09,815
Oh no, you've ruined me this time! Let's get out of here!

273
00:12:11,618 --> 00:12:13,453
Kenichi, where are you going?

274
00:12:13,503 --> 00:12:14,806
Come back!

275
00:12:17,156 --> 00:12:19,339
Oh dear, Mom is the scariest of all

276
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:21,107
Kenichi looks like his pressure points were struck

277
00:12:21,147 --> 00:12:23,546
Mom is always the most formidable one in this house

278
00:12:23,596 --> 00:12:25,458
Yan...

279
00:12:27,123 --> 00:12:30,146
"Shinzo Troubles the Teacher"

280
00:12:33,529 --> 00:12:34,449
Look that way!

281
00:12:34,490 --> 00:12:35,725
- Paper
- Scissors!

282
00:12:35,765 --> 00:12:37,007
Look that way!

283
00:12:37,047 --> 00:12:38,568
- Paper
- Paper!

284
00:12:38,608 --> 00:12:39,666
Look that way!

285
00:12:39,716 --> 00:12:40,599
Paper!

286
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:41,639
Scissors!

287
00:12:42,414 --> 00:12:44,295
- Paper
- Scissors

288
00:12:45,016 --> 00:12:46,319
- I-I play Scissors
- Rock!

289
00:12:46,359 --> 00:12:48,138
I'm not playing anymore, it's no fun at all

290
00:12:48,189 --> 00:12:49,820
You always tell people to look over there

291
00:12:49,860 --> 00:12:51,181
Of course you win every time!

292
00:12:51,221 --> 00:12:52,673
What's that got to do with me?

293
00:12:52,723 --> 00:12:54,271
Because you keep losing rock-paper-scissors to me

294
00:12:54,311 --> 00:12:55,426
Of course I get to call it!

295
00:12:55,467 --> 00:12:56,508
Agh, yan...

296
00:12:56,548 --> 00:12:57,752
Come on, snack time!

297
00:12:57,802 --> 00:12:58,740
Hurry on down!

298
00:12:58,790 --> 00:13:00,243
I'm not playing anymore

299
00:13:01,823 --> 00:13:02,966
Yan...

300
00:13:03,016 --> 00:13:04,616
Off we go...

301
00:13:04,927 --> 00:13:06,978
Here, one for each of you, okay?

302
00:13:07,419 --> 00:13:08,919
I bet there's none for me

303
00:13:09,537 --> 00:13:11,900
I forgot to count Shishimaru in

304
00:13:11,950 --> 00:13:13,060
And worst of all, it's a lollipop

305
00:13:13,110 --> 00:13:14,258
We can't even split it

306
00:13:14,298 --> 00:13:15,776
If you win rock-paper-scissors, you get one, okay?

307
00:13:15,816 --> 00:13:17,311
Oh, sounds good then

308
00:13:17,410 --> 00:13:18,533
Let's play...

309
00:13:18,583 --> 00:13:19,855
That's pretty fair

310
00:13:19,895 --> 00:13:21,306
Come on, Shishimaru

311
00:13:21,347 --> 00:13:25,127
-Rock, paper, scissors!
-Rock, paper, scissors!

312
00:13:25,168 --> 00:13:27,495
Oh no, I lost again!

313
00:13:27,715 --> 00:13:30,048
Actually, uh... I can only do paper

314
00:13:34,276 --> 00:13:35,072
Oh man

315
00:13:35,113 --> 00:13:38,004
Why do I always lose whenever I play rock-paper-scissors?

316
00:13:38,048 --> 00:13:39,881
-Rock, paper, scissors
-Rock, paper, scissors

317
00:13:39,930 --> 00:13:41,145
-Paper
-Ha, rock!

318
00:13:42,186 --> 00:13:44,646
If I play with little kids, I'll definitely win!

319
00:13:45,685 --> 00:13:47,488
Can I join in and play too?

320
00:13:47,528 --> 00:13:50,355
-Sure! Rock, paper, scissors
-Sure! Rock, paper, scissors

321
00:13:55,237 --> 00:13:57,580
Stop! Violence is not allowed!

322
00:13:57,630 --> 00:13:59,476
Don't pick on him, understand?

323
00:13:59,516 --> 00:14:01,044
Teacher, we're just playing

324
00:14:01,095 --> 00:14:02,066
Just playing?

325
00:14:02,116 --> 00:14:03,883
-That's right
-Yeah...

326
00:14:03,923 --> 00:14:05,745
-Rock, paper, scissors!
-Rock, paper, scissors!

327
00:14:07,943 --> 00:14:08,907
What's wrong, Shinzo?

328
00:14:08,957 --> 00:14:10,674
You've been losing the whole time, haven't you?

329
00:14:10,714 --> 00:14:12,033
Oh dear, that's too bad

330
00:14:12,074 --> 00:14:12,793
How about this?

331
00:14:12,843 --> 00:14:14,799
Can Teacher join in and play too?

332
00:14:14,850 --> 00:14:16,839
-Sure, let's play together
-Okay

333
00:14:18,179 --> 00:14:19,451
Alright, we're not gonna lose!

334
00:14:19,499 --> 00:14:21,886
-Right, hold on...
-Rock, paper, scissors

335
00:14:24,606 --> 00:14:26,200
Alright, let's play

336
00:14:26,251 --> 00:14:27,858
-Rock, paper, scissors
-Rock, paper, scissors

337
00:14:27,909 --> 00:14:29,876
Whoa, Teacher won!

338
00:14:29,926 --> 00:14:32,866
Of course! I'm pretty good at this

339
00:14:32,917 --> 00:14:35,460
Alright, let's see who gets whacked first

340
00:14:36,063 --> 00:14:37,259
Oh no, I gotta go home!

341
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,378
Yeah, me too!

342
00:14:38,419 --> 00:14:39,799
Hey, you can't just leave!

343
00:14:39,850 --> 00:14:41,722
Don't be sore losers!

344
00:14:42,002 --> 00:14:43,787
As a ninja, I won't run away no matter what!

345
00:14:43,828 --> 00:14:46,674
As expected of Hattori-kun's little brother, you've got real courage!

346
00:14:48,808 --> 00:14:50,580
Haha, that was so much fun!

347
00:14:50,630 --> 00:14:52,315
Alright, I'm heading home now

348
00:14:52,535 --> 00:14:53,510
Teacher!

349
00:14:53,551 --> 00:14:55,906
I had no idea you were so good at rock-paper-scissors

350
00:14:56,091 --> 00:14:57,323
It was just a fluke

351
00:14:57,367 --> 00:14:58,566
That's not true

352
00:14:58,679 --> 00:15:00,579
You want to play rock-paper-scissors with me?

353
00:15:00,719 --> 00:15:02,153
No, I have to go home

354
00:15:02,203 --> 00:15:03,504
No way, you can't leave!

355
00:15:03,555 --> 00:15:04,585
Hey, I'm busy right now

356
00:15:04,636 --> 00:15:05,865
I have a lot of things to do

357
00:15:05,916 --> 00:15:09,412
If you won't play, I'm gonna cry really loudly!

358
00:15:14,216 --> 00:15:15,657
Fine, I'll play...

359
00:15:15,708 --> 00:15:18,567
Don't cry, I'll play now, I'll play!

360
00:15:19,364 --> 00:15:20,419
Where's Shinzo?

361
00:15:20,470 --> 00:15:21,506
He's not here

362
00:15:21,556 --> 00:15:22,990
Where on earth did he go?

363
00:15:23,030 --> 00:15:25,591
Look, I bought a lollipop for him

364
00:15:25,651 --> 00:15:27,087
Go find him and bring him back

365
00:15:27,137 --> 00:15:28,990
Besides, it's almost dinner time

366
00:15:30,512 --> 00:15:31,600
You're really amazing!

367
00:15:31,650 --> 00:15:34,236
Even the police officer was no match for you

368
00:15:34,287 --> 00:15:35,794
It was just pure luck

369
00:15:35,844 --> 00:15:37,630
Alright, Shinzo, time to go home

370
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:39,369
Your family is worried about you

371
00:15:39,410 --> 00:15:41,411
I know, I'll go play with the stationmaster!

372
00:15:42,605 --> 00:15:44,743
That's Shinzo's shuriken!

373
00:15:46,343 --> 00:15:47,081
Got it!

374
00:15:47,348 --> 00:15:48,854
- Yan...
- Ah, great!

375
00:15:48,895 --> 00:15:52,330
Having Shishimaru track Shinzo down is the best way

376
00:15:53,974 --> 00:15:55,940
Kenichi, we have to hurry

377
00:15:56,570 --> 00:15:59,640
Yan...

378
00:16:00,625 --> 00:16:02,404
I hope I lose this time

379
00:16:02,444 --> 00:16:05,265
I haven't played rock-paper-scissors in years

380
00:16:06,502 --> 00:16:07,432
I'm throwing paper!

381
00:16:07,473 --> 00:16:08,245
I'm throwing paper!

382
00:16:08,286 --> 00:16:11,434
Wow, a duel between masters is so cool!

383
00:16:11,475 --> 00:16:13,313
Oh no... this is bad

384
00:16:16,646 --> 00:16:17,784
I lost again

385
00:16:17,834 --> 00:16:19,265
He won again!

386
00:16:19,315 --> 00:16:21,316
I won again? This is terrible

387
00:16:21,356 --> 00:16:23,053
I'll go call more people over

388
00:16:23,704 --> 00:16:26,586
Attention, everyone! We're having a rock-paper-scissors tournament!

389
00:16:26,629 --> 00:16:27,722
Come and play!

390
00:16:27,763 --> 00:16:29,472
Shinzo, let's stop playing for today

391
00:16:29,523 --> 00:16:30,716
It's already getting late

392
00:16:30,766 --> 00:16:32,234
We really should be heading home

393
00:16:32,284 --> 00:16:34,599
If you won't play, I'm gonna cry!

394
00:16:36,058 --> 00:16:37,928
Oh dear, don't cry... Alright!

395
00:16:37,968 --> 00:16:39,992
I'll play... just don't cry

396
00:16:40,172 --> 00:16:42,667
Shishimaru, can't you go any faster?

397
00:16:43,407 --> 00:16:44,213
I can't

398
00:16:44,253 --> 00:16:46,415
We're already here, so you'll just have to deal with being hungry

399
00:16:46,455 --> 00:16:47,856
Keep moving

400
00:16:47,896 --> 00:16:49,081
I'm so hungry

401
00:16:49,829 --> 00:16:51,015
I smell it!

402
00:16:52,939 --> 00:16:54,429
Yes... that's the one...

403
00:16:56,596 --> 00:16:58,220
Step right up... come and get it!

404
00:16:58,260 --> 00:16:59,546
It's so delicious!

405
00:17:04,883 --> 00:17:08,137
Sir, you've beaten 26 people in a row!

406
00:17:08,516 --> 00:17:09,353
That's right!

407
00:17:09,403 --> 00:17:11,218
Come on, I'm throwing paper!

408
00:17:11,627 --> 00:17:12,401
Woah, awesome!

409
00:17:12,441 --> 00:17:14,847
Sir won again, hooray!

410
00:17:15,007 --> 00:17:16,488
Oh dear, why is this happening?

411
00:17:16,528 --> 00:17:18,227
That should be completely impossible

412
00:17:18,284 --> 00:17:19,994
Yan...

413
00:17:20,361 --> 00:17:21,578
Yan...

414
00:17:22,252 --> 00:17:24,411
Hattori, did you see something?

415
00:17:24,462 --> 00:17:25,293
Yan

416
00:17:25,434 --> 00:17:27,724
Oh, I see a huge crowd lined up over there

417
00:17:27,775 --> 00:17:30,213
Wonder what's going on, let's go check it out

418
00:17:31,115 --> 00:17:33,523
Alright, here goes, I'm throwing scissors!

419
00:17:33,564 --> 00:17:34,355
Lost again...

420
00:17:34,396 --> 00:17:35,875
I won again?

421
00:17:35,999 --> 00:17:37,762
- Teacher!
- Teacher!

422
00:17:39,523 --> 00:17:41,154
- Teacher!
- Teacher!

423
00:17:42,490 --> 00:17:43,960
Teacher, what are you doing here?

424
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,908
Kenichi!

425
00:17:46,245 --> 00:17:47,909
So that's what happened

426
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,762
Then where's Shinzo?

427
00:17:51,089 --> 00:17:52,883
Where... where did Shinzo go?

428
00:17:56,110 --> 00:17:57,243
Shinzo!

429
00:17:58,197 --> 00:17:59,220
While I was playing rock-paper-scissors...

430
00:17:59,271 --> 00:18:01,777
Shinzo must have gotten exhausted and fallen asleep

431
00:18:02,276 --> 00:18:04,130
I'm so exhausted I can barely move too

432
00:18:04,183 --> 00:18:06,593
Teacher, please carry Shinzo home on your back

433
00:18:06,644 --> 00:18:07,983
Huh? No way

434
00:18:08,033 --> 00:18:10,148
How about we play rock-paper-scissors to decide?

435
00:18:10,214 --> 00:18:12,074
- Rock!
- Scissors!

436
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:15,120
Oh no, I lost this time!

437
00:18:18,116 --> 00:18:21,606
Teacher really is a master at rock-paper-scissors!

438
00:18:21,656 --> 00:18:23,178
Hooray!

